<title>BELGIUM: EU expected to start full probe into BT/MCI deal.</title>
<headline>EU expected to start full probe into BT/MCI deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is expected to launch a full investigation into the alliance between British Telecommunications Plc and MCI of the United States later this week, Commission and industry sources said.</p>
</text>
